Cohort: 141 Korean NSLA tumor tissue (EPIC, SWAN). Reference: 29 TCGA-LUAD adjacent-normal (HM450, sesame, GDC public).

Lung_cells d=-0.27 (second-weakest of 25 tiles); 22/25 tiles uniformly positive; 11/25 >3 anchor-SD baseline breach. Cross-cohort SWAN-vs-sesame + Korean-vs-Western + tumor-vs-adjacent-normal mismatch dominates signal. EDEAR commercial deployment unaffected (single-pipeline patient-vs-internal-reference).

LL-CROSS-COHORT-CALIBRATION + LL-PRELOCK-DEGENERATE-COMPARATOR lessons logged. Pre-registered SHA-256 9a1bd45e240eea7ac8d03915de9a85deb35533700f2fd263ce1912d40a3ee5f9 sealed 2026-04-28 before any beta access.
